{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52221","headline":"颂六十二首 四十六 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 四十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正邪乖明昧，善恶异相征。\n大慈降梵志，乘空各变形。\n六千俱舍执，七衆各休祯。\n邪徒虚抗志，鍱腹浪求名。\n身子多才智，陵化照机庭。\n四辩无不可，六通奋英情。\n乘权摧异见，伏邪同幽冥。\n自知萤光劣，徒诤太阳精。\n（见同书卷六八《破邪篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}